      "dcterms:title": "A Tannakian description of the local Kaletha gerbe",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "MELI, ALEXANDER BERTOLONI",
        "DILLERY, PETER"
      ],
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.07042",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We construct, for a p-adic field F, an explicit semisimple Tannakian category RigIsocF whose category of fiber functors recovers Kaletha’s Galois gerbe EKal. We then classify and write down the simple objects in RigIsocF , all of which come from elliptic twisted Levi subgroups of GLn.",
